WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.887
After creating your Amazon warehousing and distribution shipment, order or replenishment requests,

00:00:02.887 --> 00:00:07.218
you'll want to track the status of your requests to ensure your inventory has arrived at its intended

00:00:07.218 --> 00:00:07.458
destination.

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:10.105
There are two different pages you can utilize to do this.

00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:13.473
The first page allows you to track shipments being sent to Amazon Distribution Centers.

00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:32.736
From the AWD program page, click the "Track Shipments" button to  access the shipping queue dashboard,

00:00:32.736 --> 00:00:36.840
the second page allows you to track manual replenishments

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:44.340
to fulfillment centers and multi-channel distribution shipments from AWD warehouses.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:51.160
From the AWD program page, click "Track Distributions" to access the shipments, orders, and replenishment

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:51.594
dashboard.

00:00:51.594 --> 00:00:57.240
Both dashboards allow you to filter through shipments to find exactly what you're

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.125
looking for.

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:04.760
You can see the status of each shipment in the status column of each dashboard.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.240
In the top of each page, you will see options for filtering your shipments.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.200
You can filter

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:15.042
your dashboards by last updated by selecting options from the drop-down menu.

00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:16.160
You can also

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:23.200
find specific shipments on both pages by searching for their shipment ID in the shipment ID box

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.570
on the top of the page.

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:29.520
You can find more information about tracking your AWD shipments

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:36.535
on the Send shipments to Amazon warehousing and distribution AWD, tracking details.

00:01:36.535 --> 00:01:37.120
The

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:45.595
replenishment from Amazon warehousing and distribution AWD to FBA Network and the multi-channel

00:01:45.595 --> 00:01:46.200
distribution

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:52.520
using Amazon warehousing and distribution AWD help page in Seller Central.
